  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"R17JA\" id=\"R17JA\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2e1a4fe6\" id=\"u2e1a4fe6\">布局简介</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ua28026ca\" id=\"ua28026ca\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7a1fc5c3\" id=\"u7a1fc5c3\">一个pyqt窗口中可以有多个控件。所谓布局,指的就是多个控件在窗口中的展示方式</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1d4aa3cc\" id=\"u1d4aa3cc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1076771e\" id=\"u1076771e\">布局方式大致分为:</span></p><ul list=\"u30c1d9f3\"><li fid=\"u2767031a\" data-lake-id=\"u0eec6e39\" id=\"u0eec6e39\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub84a7737\" id=\"ub84a7737\">水平布局</span></li><li fid=\"u2767031a\" data-lake-id=\"u3a168122\" id=\"u3a168122\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2a1bbe6d\" id=\"u2a1bbe6d\">竖直布局</span></li><li fid=\"u2767031a\" data-lake-id=\"u58171da7\" id=\"u58171da7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u98937ac1\" id=\"u98937ac1\">网格布局</span></li><li fid=\"u2767031a\" data-lake-id=\"ue7a2a784\" id=\"ue7a2a784\"><span data-lake-id=\"u72963438\" id=\"u72963438\">表单布局</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"UI0U4\" id=\"UI0U4\"><span data-lake-id=\"uba907395\" id=\"uba907395\">2. 水平布局QHBoxLayout</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uc0cb50fd\" id=\"uc0cb50fd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u789b5391\" id=\"u789b5391\">Horizontal Layout</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8997d5b0\" id=\"u8997d5b0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u908317a4\" id=\"u908317a4\">水平布局中,是按照从左往右的顺序添加控件的</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ucad57998\" id=\"ucad57998\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1685238745475-2b77d64a-c91a-42d4-b8eb-529c3fc279a9.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u0bb92810-e752-4c74-b48a-62f1d2fc9a1%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u1f2128f5-fe69-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A416.8%2C%22height%22%3A74%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A2568%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A521%